{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25932","headline":"秋晚铜山道中宿隐者 · 鲍溶","name":"秋晚铜山道中宿隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我乡山川遥，秋晚空景促。\n天明共云散，日落依鸟宿。\n主人逃名子，鹤发卧空谷。\n野言得真风，山貌宜古服。\n喜於无声地，暂傲羲皇俗。\n秋窗照疎萤，寒犬吠落木。\n朝隐留此处，一点天边宿。\n今忆见此时，添悲览止足。\n迟迟清夜昼，幽路出深竹。\n笑谢万户侯，余将耻干禄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}